{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17517","headline":"奉使丰陵职司卤簿通宵涉路因寄内 · 权德舆","name":"奉使丰陵职司卤簿通宵涉路因寄内","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩仗列森森，行宫夜漏深。\n殳鋋方啓路，钲鼓正交音。\n曙月思兰室，前山辨谷林。\n家人念行役，应见此时心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}